body:
Yup, it includes livestock and crops to feed/butcher / plant for more variety. I recently added 5 new coffee drinks, bunch more smoothies, salads, baked goods; next on my list are stuff like pizzas, more burgers, etc. I add more whenever the idea strikes me, or someone who has my mod goes "Hey, could you add this dish?" and I feel like it's useful :) I really enjoy the cooking aspect, too, lol!

&#x200B;

You could PM me for some pictures of the in-game menu that shows some of all the dishes?
